# The 338 MB Sparkov source stays out of the repository, but the small derived
# reference it produces is committed: core/population.py fits every attack's base
# population to it, so a missing copy silently degrades all four attacks to a
# stand-in table. Negation must follow *.parquet - the last matching rule wins.
!data/processed/sparkov_reference.parquet
